    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thrice Kingdom</i></strong> is a match-3 RPG hybrid where you lead three legendary heroes\u2014the stalwart Warrior, the deadly Ranger, and the arcane Mage\u2014against a horde unleashed by a necromancer who has corrupted the land. Face off against twisted beasts, cursed soldiers, and adorable dragons as you battle to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Match-3 Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver satisfying combos, manage risk and reward, and manage your items to survive deeper into the game.\u00a0 Your heroes become stronger as they level up and find stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Heroes. One Fate.</strong><br>Each hero brings unique abilities to the fight, which can be further augmented with rule-bending accessories.\u00a0 The Warrior protects his allies by forcing enemies to attack him, the Mage unlocks the maximum offense of your party with her burning spells, and the Ranger controls the fight with debilitating poison.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up. Grow Stronger.</strong><br>Defeat enemies, earn loot, and equip your heroes with legendary gear that alters their stats abilities. Whether you're chasing the perfect build or just grinding for raw power, <strong><i>Thrice Kingdom</i></strong> rewards dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Kingdom Turned Against You</strong><br>Explore a land now hostile to its former protectors. Fight your way through corrupted forests, ruined cities, and cursed catacombs. Every region offers new challenges, enemies, and rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thrice Kingdom</i></strong> is a match-3 RPG hybrid where you lead three legendary heroes\u2014the stalwart Warrior, the deadly Ranger, and the arcane Mage\u2014against a horde unleashed by a necromancer who has corrupted the land. Face off against twisted beasts, cursed soldiers, and adorable dragons as you battle to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Match-3 Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver satisfying combos, manage risk and reward, and manage your items to survive deeper into the game.\u00a0 Your heroes become stronger as they level up and find stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Heroes. One Fate.</strong><br>Each hero brings unique abilities to the fight, which can be further augmented with rule-bending accessories.\u00a0 The Warrior protects his allies by forcing enemies to attack him, the Mage unlocks the maximum offense of your party with her burning spells, and the Ranger controls the fight with debilitating poison.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up. Grow Stronger.</strong><br>Defeat enemies, earn loot, and equip your heroes with legendary gear that alters their stats abilities. Whether you're chasing the perfect build or just grinding for raw power, <strong><i>Thrice Kingdom</i></strong> rewards dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Kingdom Turned Against You</strong><br>Explore a land now hostile to its former protectors. Fight your way through corrupted forests, ruined cities, and cursed catacombs. Every region offers new challenges, enemies, and rewards.</p>",
